<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS2.SSS2.Px1" title="In B.2.2 Sampling rate to ensure accurate DP quantile estimation ‣ B.2 Mathematical Analysis of Autotuning ‣ Appendix B Autotuning ‣ Toward provably private analytics and insights into GenAI use" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Size of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math> to ensure accurate DP quantile estimation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS2.SSS2.Px2" title="In B.2.2 Sampling rate to ensure accurate DP quantile estimation ‣ B.2 Mathematical Analysis of Autotuning ‣ Appendix B Autotuning ‣ Toward provably private analytics and insights into GenAI use" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Sampling rate to ensure minimum size of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
